# 🛒 Marjane Digital Tombola

A full-stack digital promotional campaign platform designed to help
marketing teams create and manage interactive tombola campaigns
without requiring technical intervention.

## ✨ Overview

Marjane Digital Tombola provides a complete platform for creating
and managing promotional campaigns, validating customer participation
through receipt scanning, and running interactive games.

The platform was designed with a multi-campaign architecture,
allowing different campaigns to be configured and managed independently.

## 🚀 Features

- 🎯 Multi-campaign management
- 🧾 OCR-based receipt validation
- ✅ Verification of eligible products
- 🔒 Prevention of receipt reuse
- 👥 Role-based access control
- 🎮 Interactive promotional games
- 🎁 Prize and probability management
- 🖥️ Campaign back-office
- 🎨 Content and theme customization
- 📱 Responsive mobile-first interface
- 🌍 Multi-language support

## 🎮 Games

The platform includes interactive promotional experiences such as:

- 🎡 Wheel of Fortune
- 🃏 Scratch Cards
- 🎲 Dice-based games

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
