   │
   │ REST API
   ▼
FastAPI Backend
   │
   ├── Campaign Management
   ├── Receipt Validation / OCR
   ├── Authentication & Authorization
   ├── Game Logic
   └── Prize Management
   │
   ▼
MySQL Database
