🔐 Security

The application includes security mechanisms such as:

Role-based permissions
CORS configuration
API rate limiting
Receipt reuse prevention
Controlled access to administrative features
📱 User Flow
Customer
   ↓
Enter Information
   ↓
Scan Receipt
   ↓
OCR Validation
   ↓
Eligibility Check
   ↓
Play Game
   ↓
Win / Result
🎯 Objective

The goal of the project is to transform promotional campaigns into
a reusable digital platform that can be configured and operated by
marketing teams with minimal technical intervention.

